{%- comment -%}
  The italic of the theme's heading font, for the story sections' italic
  lines (the hero's line under the title, emphasis in "Lead" text). The
  layout loads only the upright heading font, and a browser's slanted copy
  of Cormorant reads as a mistake. Render it inside a section's style tag;
  nothing is output when the font has no italic.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign heading_italic = settings.type_header_font | font_modify: 'style', 'italic'
  if heading_italic
    echo heading_italic | font_face: font_display: 'swap'
  endif
-%}
